+# Home image
+
+`bristol-home.jpg` is generated illustrative photography, created with the built-in imagegen tool and compressed locally as JPEG for web delivery. It is not evidence of a completed job.
+
+Prompt: Use case: photorealistic-natural. Asset type: website hero editorial architectural photograph for a fictional Bristol home and garden services demo. Primary request: a beautiful but believable lived-in British Victorian terraced house entrance and small front garden, terracotta red brick, deep forest green front door with brass hardware, cream stone lintel, sage green foliage, a potted olive tree, warm afternoon sunlight and dappled shadows. Close architectural crop with doorway on right half and brick facade and large sash window on left. No people, no text, no logos, no watermark, no decorative border. Portrait 4:5 composition, professional interiors magazine photography, subtle analog grain, warm muted natural colors, realistic materials. This image illustrates the kind of home served, and must not suggest a verified completed project.
